{"unit_id":"tuogusa__dsh-word-complete#feature-session-vocabulary","repo":"tuogusa/dsh-word-complete","commit":"ee8ff1a9df708f8ff64193429ce281324f097ca7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-word-complete 的功能「会话词汇建议」：从当前会话的用户和助手消息提取词并累计词频；输入词语前缀时列出匹配候选，最多显示 8 条。客户端通过会话词汇接口获取列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:47-59","lib/index.js:63-105","lib/client.js:78-99","lib/client.js:180-195"]}
